The Aruba AP-303 is a 2x2 802.11ac Wave 2 access point. It is fairly powerful with a quad-core ARM processor and 512 MB of memory. The Aruba Instant On AP11 is a much cheaper version of this device and is based on the same platform, the OpenWrt firmware for Aruba AP-303 can also be flashed onto the Aruba Instant On AP11.

